# Project Tracker (Monday.com-style MVP)

A full-stack project tracking app inspired by Monday.com.

## What this includes

- Multiple projects
- Kanban board with statuses:
  - Backlog
  - In Progress
  - Review
  - Done
- Task CRUD:
  - Title
  - Description
  - Assignee
  - Priority
  - Due date
  - Status
- Drag-and-drop between status columns
- Search and priority filtering
- JSON file persistence (`data/store.json`)

## Tech stack

- Node.js + Express (API + static hosting)
- Vanilla HTML/CSS/JavaScript frontend
- File-based persistence (no external database required)

## Quick start

1. Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

2. Start the app:

```bash
npm start
```

3. Open:

```text
http://localhost:3000
```

## Development mode

```bash
npm run dev
```

This uses Node's built-in watch mode and reloads when files change.

## API endpoints

- `GET /api/health`
- `GET /api/meta`
- `GET /api/projects`
- `GET /api/projects/:projectId`
- `POST /api/projects`
- `PATCH /api/projects/:projectId`
- `DELETE /api/projects/:projectId`
- `POST /api/projects/:projectId/tasks`
- `PATCH /api/projects/:projectId/tasks/:taskId`
- `DELETE /api/projects/:projectId/tasks/:taskId`